# Copy to .env.local for development. Never commit the filled-in file.
#
# IMPORTANT: this is the backend ORIGIN, not the API root. The /api/v1 prefix
# is added in code (src/lib/config.ts), because the API version belongs to the
# contract rather than to the deployment.
#
#   correct:   http://localhost:8080
#   wrong:     http://localhost:8080/api/v1
#
# Vite inlines this at BUILD time, so changing it in a hosting dashboard has no
# effect until you redeploy.
#
# Anything prefixed VITE_ is compiled into the bundle and readable by anyone who
# opens the JavaScript. Never put a secret, password, JWT signing key or private
# API key behind that prefix.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
